  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 1996, people in the Brazilian town of Varginha say a strange creature was captured after an object came down nearby. James Fox, a documentary filmmaker who has investigated the case, says it has been known for decades that the being was still alive when it was first taken to the town's Regional hospital, and that it then ended up at a second hospital called Humanitas. If true, it would mean a living non-human being passed through ordinary local hospitals."
